    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688650/extras/5ad01b759a0ed4126f562c7603e75d58.poster.avif?t=1747932390\" width=600 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688650/extras/5ad01b759a0ed4126f562c7603e75d58.webm?t=1747932390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688650/extras/5ad01b759a0ed4126f562c7603e75d58.mp4?t=1747932390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of an enthusiastic security specialist who takes corporate risk assessments a little <i>too</i> seriously. While most in the field write reports from behind a desk, you prefer a more hands-on approach by breaking into facilities unannounced and uninvited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688650/extras/a79aa659ef1e99806656107c5488c7dc.poster.avif?t=1747932390\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688650/extras/a79aa659ef1e99806656107c5488c7dc.webm?t=1747932390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688650/extras/a79aa659ef1e99806656107c5488c7dc.mp4?t=1747932390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688650/extras/c14c8fa647ee63f49f722211d153eeb3.webp?t=1747932390\" width=616 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay out of sight while testing every vulnerability. Slip through shadows, hide in cupboards, and crawl through vents as you quietly gather intel.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688650/extras/0b039823e78eeeab87572a31bca94b15.poster.avif?t=1747932390\" width=600 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688650/extras/0b039823e78eeeab87572a31bca94b15.webm?t=1747932390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688650/extras/0b039823e78eeeab87572a31bca94b15.mp4?t=1747932390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688650/extras/6a19abf02d9e6cb368d38082e8a6ed98.webp?t=1747932390\" width=616 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create distractions, set traps and find clever ways to outsmart security. Just be careful not to fall into your own trap! Plan carefully and stay one step ahead of the guards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688650/extras/e190eb475692a7809b2c2d86e3241cfa.poster.avif?t=1747932390\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688650/extras/e190eb475692a7809b2c2d86e3241cfa.webm?t=1747932390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688650/extras/e190eb475692a7809b2c2d86e3241cfa.mp4?t=1747932390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688650/extras/11c4f78de63464d3c27b34eb94970941.webp?t=1747932390\" width=616 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When all else fails, you\u2019re not above using force. This may involve some casualties but that\u2019s all part of a <i>thorough</i> assessment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth system based on light and shadow, line-of-sight, and sound.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distraction system that allows you to manipulate enemies and make them go where you want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique levels full of useful items, hiding places, and equipment you can interact with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple routes though each area.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy AI that reacts to unconscious allies, loud noises, and alert levels.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688650/extras/5ad01b759a0ed4126f562c7603e75d58.poster.avif?t=1747932390\" width=600 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688650/extras/5ad01b759a0ed4126f562c7603e75d58.webm?t=1747932390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688650/extras/5ad01b759a0ed4126f562c7603e75d58.mp4?t=1747932390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of an enthusiastic security specialist who takes corporate risk assessments a little <i>too</i> seriously. While most in the field write reports from behind a desk, you prefer a more hands-on approach by breaking into facilities unannounced and uninvited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688650/extras/a79aa659ef1e99806656107c5488c7dc.poster.avif?t=1747932390\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688650/extras/a79aa659ef1e99806656107c5488c7dc.webm?t=1747932390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688650/extras/a79aa659ef1e99806656107c5488c7dc.mp4?t=1747932390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688650/extras/c14c8fa647ee63f49f722211d153eeb3.webp?t=1747932390\" width=616 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay out of sight while testing every vulnerability. Slip through shadows, hide in cupboards, and crawl through vents as you quietly gather intel.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688650/extras/0b039823e78eeeab87572a31bca94b15.poster.avif?t=1747932390\" width=600 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688650/extras/0b039823e78eeeab87572a31bca94b15.webm?t=1747932390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688650/extras/0b039823e78eeeab87572a31bca94b15.mp4?t=1747932390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688650/extras/6a19abf02d9e6cb368d38082e8a6ed98.webp?t=1747932390\" width=616 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create distractions, set traps and find clever ways to outsmart security. Just be careful not to fall into your own trap! Plan carefully and stay one step ahead of the guards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688650/extras/e190eb475692a7809b2c2d86e3241cfa.poster.avif?t=1747932390\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688650/extras/e190eb475692a7809b2c2d86e3241cfa.webm?t=1747932390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688650/extras/e190eb475692a7809b2c2d86e3241cfa.mp4?t=1747932390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688650/extras/11c4f78de63464d3c27b34eb94970941.webp?t=1747932390\" width=616 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When all else fails, you\u2019re not above using force. This may involve some casualties but that\u2019s all part of a <i>thorough</i> assessment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth system based on light and shadow, line-of-sight, and sound.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distraction system that allows you to manipulate enemies and make them go where you want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique levels full of useful items, hiding places, and equipment you can interact with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple routes though each area.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy AI that reacts to unconscious allies, loud noises, and alert levels.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "False Alarm is a 2D stealth adventure where quick decisions and perfect timing are key. Infiltrate guarded facilities, vanish in plain sight, and trick enemies with distractions. When stealth fails, strike swiftly. Study your surroundings and plan each move to complete your mission.",
